<!-- ═══════ 02 · ABOUT ═══════ -->
<section class="sec" id="about">
  <div class="wrap ab">
    <div class="ab-l rv">
      <p class="tag"><i>02</i> About</p>
      <h2 class="h2" style="margin-top:20px">A catalyst.<br>A <em>bridge</em>.</h2>
      <span class="badge8">Section 8 non-profit</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ab-b rv">
      <p class="first">Jalna First Citizen Forum (JFCF) is a Section 8 non-profit formed by like-minded citizens and entrepreneurs working together for Jalna's inclusive, long-term progress.</p>
      <p>The Forum connects citizen priorities, professional expertise and public institutions to move practical ideas forward. Its work is organised across five focused verticals that strengthen everyday life while preparing Jalna for future growth.</p>
      <div class="pills" role="tablist" aria-label="JFCF focus areas">
        <button class="pill on" id="about-tab-city" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="about-city"><i></i>City Infrastructure</button>
        <button class="pill" id="about-tab-industry" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="about-industry"><i></i>Industry Infrastructure</button>
        <button class="pill" id="about-tab-education" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="about-education"><i></i>Education</button>
        <button class="pill" id="about-tab-healthcare" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="about-healthcare"><i></i>Healthcare</button>
        <button class="pill" id="about-tab-sports" type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="about-sports"><i></i>Sports</button>
      </div>
      <div class="about-panels">
        <article class="about-panel" id="about-city" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="about-tab-city">
          <h3>City Infrastructure</h3>
          <p>Helping shape a cleaner, safer and better-connected Jalna with stronger public infrastructure and a better everyday quality of life.</p>
          <ul><li>Better roads, drainage, street lighting and pedestrian infrastructure.</li><li>Cleaner neighbourhoods, scientific waste management and sustainable water use.</li><li>Citizen feedback and data translated into practical work with the administration.</li></ul>
        </article>
        <article class="about-panel" id="about-industry" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="about-tab-industry" hidden>
          <h3>Industry Infrastructure</h3>
          <p>Strengthening Jalna's industrial ecosystem so it can compete for investment, manufacturing, exports and employment.</p>
          <ul><li>More reliable roads, power, water and essential services in industrial areas.</li><li>Better logistics through the MMLP, Samruddhi Mahamarg and regional connectivity.</li><li>New industries, greener manufacturing and industry-linked skills for local youth.</li></ul>
        </article>
        <article class="about-panel" id="about-education" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="about-tab-education" hidden>
          <h3>Education</h3>
          <p>Giving Jalna's students the learning, skills and confidence they need to participate in the opportunities of the future.</p>
          <ul><li>Stronger learning environments, resources and technology-enabled teaching.</li><li>Career guidance and exposure to STEM, innovation and entrepreneurship.</li><li>Vocational learning, internships and scholarships linked to emerging careers.</li></ul>
        </article>
        <article class="about-panel" id="about-healthcare" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="about-tab-healthcare" hidden>
          <h3>Healthcare</h3>
          <p>Supporting accessible, affordable and quality healthcare through stronger facilities, prevention and coordinated community action.</p>
          <ul><li>Stronger public-health facilities and access for underserved communities.</li><li>Health screenings and awareness around nutrition, hygiene and early detection.</li><li>Better emergency response, ambulance, blood-bank and trauma-care networks.</li></ul>
        </article>
        <article class="about-panel" id="about-sports" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="about-tab-sports" hidden>
          <h3>Sports</h3>
          <p>Building a stronger sporting culture by nurturing talent, widening access to facilities and creating opportunities to compete.</p>
          <ul><li>Better playgrounds, sporting facilities, coaching and equipment.</li><li>Local leagues, talent hunts, scholarships and sponsorship pathways.</li><li>Inclusive participation supported by schools, coaches, industry and government.</li></ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

