      <h2 class="h2" style="margin:20px 0 22px">What we've<br>set out to <em>do</em>.</h2>
      <p class="lede">The focus areas and specific commitments the Forum was constituted to pursue.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="acc rv" id="acc">
      <div class="ai on">
        <button class="ah" aria-expanded="true"><span class="n">01</span>
          <h3 class="h3">City Infrastructure</h3><span class="pm"></span></button>
        <div class="ap"><ul>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Advocate for safer roads, drainage, sewerage, street lighting and pedestrian infrastructure.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Promote cleaner neighbourhoods, scientific waste management, water conservation and greener public spaces.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Use citizen feedback and data to work with the administration on practical, planned solutions.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai">
        <button class="ah" aria-expanded="false"><span class="n">02</span>
          <h3 class="h3">Industry Infrastructure</h3><span class="pm"></span></button>
        <div class="ap"><ul>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Strengthen roads, power, water, drainage and other essential services in industrial areas.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Build on the MMLP, Samruddhi Mahamarg and regional connectivity to improve logistics and market access.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Encourage new investment, greener manufacturing and industry-linked skills for local employment.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai">
        <button class="ah" aria-expanded="false"><span class="n">03</span>
          <h3 class="h3">Education</h3><span class="pm"></span></button>
        <div class="ap"><ul>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Support stronger learning environments, educational resources and technology-enabled teaching.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Expand career guidance, mentorship and exposure to STEM, innovation and entrepreneurship.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Connect vocational learning, internships and scholarships with emerging opportunities for Jalna's youth.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai">
        <button class="ah" aria-expanded="false"><span class="n">04</span>
          <h3 class="h3">Healthcare</h3><span class="pm"></span></button>
        <div class="ap"><ul>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Support stronger public-health facilities and better access for underserved communities.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Promote screenings and preventive awareness around nutrition, hygiene, maternal health and lifestyle-related disease.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Improve coordination for emergency response, ambulances, blood banks, trauma care and public-health preparedness.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>

      <div class="ai">
        <button class="ah" aria-expanded="false"><span class="n">05</span>
          <h3 class="h3">Sports</h3><span class="pm"></span></button>
        <div class="ap"><ul>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Improve access to playgrounds, sporting facilities, coaching, equipment and fitness support.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Create pathways through leagues, talent hunts, scholarships, sponsorships and competitive events.</li>
          <li><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><circle cx="7" cy="7" r="5" fill="#0DA1A7"/></svg>Encourage inclusive participation and partnerships among athletes, schools, coaches, industry and government.</li>
        </ul></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

